notes.content:
Thanks to everyone who sent crash reports. You helped us diagnose and correct the following errors:

- crashes when launched in VR-mode with an unavailable VR-headset;
- crashes with frequent switching between slots.

We have news for you!
List of changes:

- Balances calculating in game credits, all players balances reseted to 300 credits;
- Daily bonus changed to 200 credits;
- Spins amount to joint bonus game decreased to 50, and you can win 500 credits each hour.
